Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"cockroachdb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（部分需 Enterprise）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（部分需 Enterprise）。BACKUP / RESTORE SQL、增量备份、计划备份、PITR；全集群恢复需 enterprise license（Cockroach Labs 官方 university skill 明确）；恢复速度官方口径待复核；Cloud 提供托管备份（各 tier 保留期/能力待复核）。来源等级：官方仓…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（部分需 Enterprise）</strong>。<code>BACKUP</code> / <code>RESTORE</code> SQL、增量备份、计划备份、PITR；全集群恢复需 enterprise license（Cockroach Labs 官方 university skill 明确）；恢复速度官方口径待复核；Cloud 提供托管备份（各 tier 保留期/能力待复核）。来源等级：官方仓库资料 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (partially Enterprise-only). BACKUP / RESTORE SQL, incremental backups, scheduled backups, PITR; full-cluster restore requires an enterprise license (stated exp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (partially Enterprise-only)</strong>. <code>BACKUP</code> / <code>RESTORE</code> SQL, incremental backups, scheduled backups, PITR; full-cluster restore requires an enterprise license (stated explicitly in Cockroach Labs&#x27; official university skill); restore-speed figures pending verification against official statements; Cloud offers managed backups (retention/capability per tier pending verification). Evidence level: official repo materials + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算一体：Pebble 本地盘）。 每节点 Pebble（RocksDB 衍生）本地存储，存算一体 官方文档。 扩缩容自动 rebalance，但数据搬迁耗时 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算一体：Pebble 本地盘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每节点 Pebble（RocksDB 衍生）本地存储，存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>扩缩容自动 rebalance，但数据搬迁耗时 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled: Pebble local disks). Each node stores on local Pebble (RocksDB-derived); coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Scaling auto-rebalances, but data movement takes tim…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled: Pebble local disks).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each node stores on local Pebble (RocksDB-derived); coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Scaling auto-rebalances, but data movement takes time <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 兼容多模：JSONB+全文+向量）。 JSONB、全文检索、pgvector 兼容（PG 生态）官方文档。 无原生图引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 兼容多模：JSONB+全文+向量）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSONB、全文检索、pgvector 兼容（PG 生态）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (PG-compatible multi-model: JSONB+full-text+vectors). JSONB, full-text, pgvector-compatible (PG ecosystem) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native graph engine (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (PG-compatible multi-model: JSONB+full-text+vectors).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSONB, full-text, pgvector-compatible (PG ecosystem) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（云版按量计费，标签与预算能力有限）。 CockroachDB Cloud 按请求/计算单元计量，提供用量视图。厂商口径 成本标签与预算告警能力弱于主流云数仓，细粒度归因有限。待验证 自建版无计费概念，成本=硬件+运维人力自理。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（云版按量计费，标签与预算能力有限）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud 按请求/计算单元计量，提供用量视图。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>成本标签与预算告警能力弱于主流云数仓，细粒度归因有限。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>自建版无计费概念，成本=硬件+运维人力自理。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud metering; weak tagging/budgets). CockroachDB Cloud meters requests/compute units with usage views. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> Cost tagging and budget-alert capabilitie…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud metering; weak tagging/budgets).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud meters requests/compute units with usage views. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Cost tagging and budget-alert capabilities lag mainstream cloud warehouses; fine-grained attribution is limited. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>Self-hosted edition has no metering; cost is hardware plus operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（PG 协议兼容，驱动直接复用）。 PG 线协议兼容，pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq 直接可用 官方文档。 部分 PG 高级特性驱动层需注意兼容 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（PG 协议兼容，驱动直接复用）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG 线协议兼容，pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq 直接可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>部分 PG 高级特性驱动层需注意兼容 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (PG-protocol compatible; reuse drivers). PG wire-protocol compatible; pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq work directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Some advanced PG features need driver…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (PG-protocol compatible; reuse drivers).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG wire-protocol compatible; pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq work directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Some advanced PG features need driver-level compatibility care <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无物化视图能力）。 无物化视图（查证为无）官方文档。 预聚合靠应用层或下游 OLAP 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无物化视图能力）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无物化视图（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>预聚合靠应用层或下游 OLAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no materialized views). No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pre-aggregation via app layer or downstream OLAP (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no materialized views).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Pre-aggregation via app layer or downstream OLAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（自建任意云；CockroachDB Cloud 多云）。 开源/企业自建版任意云可部署 官方文档。 CockroachDB Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP 官方文档。 跨云多活理论可行，延迟与成本是现实门槛 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（自建任意云；CockroachDB Cloud 多云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源/企业自建版任意云可部署 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云多活理论可行，延迟与成本是现实门槛 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Self-hosted on any cloud; CockroachDB Cloud multi-cloud). Open-source/enterprise self-hosted deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CockroachDB Cloud supports A…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Self-hosted on any cloud; CockroachDB Cloud multi-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open-source/enterprise self-hosted deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud supports AWS/GCP <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud active-active is theoretically possible; latency and cost are the real gates <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。DB Console（:8080）、SQL Activity、statement diagnostics、Prometheus metrics 端点。但注意：pg_stat_statements 不可用（PG 生态监控工具链迁移时的明确缺口）。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。DB Console（:8080）、SQL Activity、statement diagnostics、Prometheus metrics 端点。但注意：<strong><code>pg_stat_statements</code> 不可用</strong>（PG 生态监控工具链迁移时的明确缺口）。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. DB Console (:8080), SQL Activity, statement diagnostics, Prometheus metrics endpoint. But note: pg_stat_statements is NOT available (an explicit gap when migra…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. DB Console (:8080), SQL Activity, statement diagnostics, Prometheus metrics endpoint. But note: <strong><code>pg_stat_statements</code> is NOT available</strong> (an explicit gap when migrating the PG ecosystem monitoring toolchain). Evidence level: official docs + community consensus</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持。每个节点都是 SQL 网关，客户端应配置多节点地址或经 LB 分散连接；官方对接 PG 驱动生态（port 26257）；官方是否自带连接池（pgBouncer 式）未找到证据——未找到证据，待验证。来源等级：官方文档 + 待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>。每个节点都是 SQL 网关，客户端应配置多节点地址或经 LB 分散连接；官方对接 PG 驱动生态（port 26257）；官方是否自带连接池（pgBouncer 式）未找到证据——<strong>未找到证据</strong>，待验证。来源等级：官方文档 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported. Every node is an SQL gateway; clients should configure multiple node addresses or spread connections via an LB; official integration targets the PG d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong>. Every node is an SQL gateway; clients should configure multiple node addresses or spread connections via an LB; official integration targets the PG driver ecosystem (port 26257); whether the official distribution ships a built-in connection pooler (pgBouncer-style) — <strong>no evidence found</strong>, to-be-verified. Evidence level: official docs + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。默认 Serializable；v23.2 起可选 READ COMMITTED（v26.3 的默认与语义细节待官方复核）。机制：MVCC + write intents + transaction record，多 Range 事务走 2PC，Parallel Commits 把提交关键路径压到约 1 轮共识 RTT。来源等级：官方…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。默认 <strong>Serializable</strong>；v23.2 起可选 READ COMMITTED（v26.3 的默认与语义细节待官方复核）。机制：MVCC + write intents + transaction record，多 Range 事务走 2PC，Parallel Commits 把提交关键路径压到约 1 轮共识 RTT。来源等级：官方文档 + 第三方技术资料</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Default is Serializable; READ COMMITTED became optional in v23.2 (v26.3 default and semantic details pending official verification). Mechanism: MVCC + write in…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Default is <strong>Serializable</strong>; READ COMMITTED became optional in v23.2 (v26.3 default and semantic details pending official verification). Mechanism: MVCC + write intents + transaction record; multi-Range transactions go through 2PC; Parallel Commits compresses the commit critical path to roughly 1 round of consensus RTT. Evidence level: official docs + third-party statement</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。每 Range 一个 Raft group + leaseholder 协调读写，默认强一致；另有 follower reads（AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestamp()）提供有界陈旧读。来源等级：官方设计文档 / RFC + 第三方资料</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。每 Range 一个 Raft group + leaseholder 协调读写，默认强一致；另有 follower reads（<code>AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestamp()</code>）提供有界陈旧读。来源等级：官方设计文档 / RFC + 第三方资料</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. One Raft group per Range + leaseholder coordinating reads/writes, strongly consistent by default; plus follower reads (AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestam…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. One Raft group per Range + leaseholder coordinating reads/writes, strongly consistent by default; plus follower reads (<code>AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestamp()</code>) for bounded-staleness reads. Evidence level: official design docs / RFCs + third-party statement</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。横向 scale-out 在线扩容，加节点后 Range 自动 rebalance；节点纵向升级配置亦可。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。横向 scale-out 在线扩容，加节点后 Range 自动 rebalance；节点纵向升级配置亦可。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Horizontal scale-out is online — new nodes are added and Ranges automatically rebalance; vertical node upgrades are also possible. Evidence level: official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Horizontal scale-out is online — new nodes are added and Ranges automatically rebalance; vertical node upgrades are also possible. Evidence level: official docs + community consensus</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据实际落在客户自己的云存储（S3/ADLS/GCS），默认走云厂商服务端加密（SSE）；控制面元数据由 Databricks 加密 官方文档。 支持客户管理密钥（CMK/Customer-managed keys）：密钥存客户自己的 KMS（AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault），可覆盖工作区存储与 Unity Catal…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据实际落在客户自己的云存储（S3/ADLS/GCS），默认走云厂商服务端加密（SSE）；控制面元数据由 Databricks 加密 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>支持客户管理密钥（CMK/Customer-managed keys）：密钥存客户自己的 KMS（AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault），可覆盖工作区存储与 Unity Catalog 元存储 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>合规安全配置文件（Compliance Security Profile）可强制加密与密钥策略，是过 HIPAA/PCI 等认证的前置条件 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (cloud SSE + optional customer-managed keys). Data physically lands in the customer&#x27;s own cloud storage (S3/ADLS/GCS) under cloud-native server-side encryption …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (cloud SSE + optional customer-managed keys).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data physically lands in the customer&#x27;s own cloud storage (S3/ADLS/GCS) under cloud-native server-side encryption (SSE); control-plane metadata is encrypted by Databricks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Customer-managed keys (CMK) supported: keys live in the customer&#x27;s own KMS (AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault) and can cover workspace storage and the Unity Catalog metastore <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Compliance Security Profile can enforce encryption and key policies — a prerequisite for HIPAA/PCI-style certifications <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（TLS 1.2+ 全链路）</span><p class=\"snippet\">控制面与计算面之间所有通信 TLS 加密；Secure Cluster Connectivity 走加密 WebSocket 隧道 官方文档。 JDBC/ODBC、REST API、Notebook 流量均为 HTTPS/TLS；官方安全基线要求 TLS 1.2 以上 社区共识。 无明文回退：不存在&quot;开了 TLS 还留着明文端口&quot;的自建式…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>控制面与计算面之间所有通信 TLS 加密；Secure Cluster Connectivity 走加密 WebSocket 隧道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC、REST API、Notebook 流量均为 HTTPS/TLS；官方安全基线要求 TLS 1.2 以上 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无明文回退：不存在&quot;开了 TLS 还留着明文端口&quot;的自建式坑，端口暴露面由云网络配置决定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (TLS 1.2+ end to end). All control-plane to compute-plane traffic is TLS-encrypted; Secure Cluster Connectivity runs over an encrypted WebSocket tunnel (officia…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (TLS 1.2+ end to end).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All control-plane to compute-plane traffic is TLS-encrypted; Secure Cluster Connectivity runs over an encrypted WebSocket tunnel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC, REST API and notebook traffic are all HTTPS/TLS; the official security baseline requires TLS 1.2+ <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No plaintext fallback: unlike self-managed setups there is no &quot;TLS on but plaintext ports left open&quot; trap — the exposed surface is governed by cloud network configuration <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">API：完整 Spark API（DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib），PySpark 是事实标准入口；Databricks Runtime 是优化版 Spark 官方文档。 表格式：Delta Lake 底层是 Parquet + 事务日志，任何能读 Parquet 的引擎都能读数据；与 Apache Icebe…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>API：完整 Spark API（DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib），PySpark 是事实标准入口；Databricks Runtime 是优化版 Spark <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>表格式：Delta Lake 底层是 Parquet + 事务日志，任何能读 Parquet 的引擎都能读数据；与 Apache Iceberg 互读能力持续增强（UniForm 等），&quot;换引擎不搬数据&quot;是卖点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：开放的是数据格式，不是平台 API——作业调度、权限、计费都绑定 Databricks 控制面；Photon 是闭源加速引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Spark API + open-format interop). API: full Spark API (DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib); PySpark is the de-facto entry point; Databricks Runtime is an optimized …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Spark API + open-format interop).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>API: full Spark API (DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib); PySpark is the de-facto entry point; Databricks Runtime is an optimized Spark distribution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Table formats: Delta Lake is Parquet plus a transaction log underneath — any Parquet-capable engine can read the data; interop with Apache Iceberg keeps improving (UniForm and friends), and &quot;change engines without moving data&quot; is a selling point <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Note: the open part is the data format, not the platform API — job scheduling, permissions and billing are bound to the Databricks control plane; Photon is a closed-source acceleration engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">平台专有、无开源/自建版本：必须跑在 Databricks 账号体系下（AWS/Azure/GCP 三家云），不存在&quot;下载一个 Databricks 装到自己机房&quot; 官方文档。 计费：DBU × 时长 × 工作负载类型费率；经典计算另付云资源费，Serverless 打包；企业合同价与目录价差异大 厂商口径。 开源部分：Delta Lak…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>平台专有、无开源/自建版本：必须跑在 Databricks 账号体系下（AWS/Azure/GCP 三家云），不存在&quot;下载一个 Databricks 装到自己机房&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计费：DBU × 时长 × 工作负载类型费率；经典计算另付云资源费，Serverless 打包；企业合同价与目录价差异大 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>开源部分：Delta Lake（Linux 基金会）、MLflow、Apache Spark 本体开源，数据不被格式锁定是相对 Snowflake 的差异化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (proprietary platform on DBU consumption; core components open source). Proprietary platform, no open-source/self-hosted edition: it only runs under a Databrick…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (proprietary platform on DBU consumption; core components open source).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proprietary platform, no open-source/self-hosted edition: it only runs under a Databricks account on AWS/Azure/GCP — there is no &quot;download Databricks and install it in your own data center&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Billing: DBUs × duration × workload-type rate; classic compute adds cloud-resource fees, Serverless bundles them; enterprise contract pricing differs substantially from list <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Open-source parts: Delta Lake (Linux Foundation), MLflow and Apache Spark itself are open — data is not format-locked, which is the differentiator against Snowflake-style proprietary storage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（英文优先，中文在增长）</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方文档以英文为主，部分有机器翻译中文；Azure Databricks 有较多中文文档（微软生态）社区共识。 中文博客/课程在增长（CSDN、知乎、极客时间有 Databricks 系列），但深度内容（调优、Unity Catalog 迁移实战）英文仍多一个身位 社区共识。 认证体系（Data Engineer Professional…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方文档以英文为主，部分有机器翻译中文；Azure Databricks 有较多中文文档（微软生态）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>中文博客/课程在增长（CSDN、知乎、极客时间有 Databricks 系列），但深度内容（调优、Unity Catalog 迁移实战）英文仍多一个身位 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>认证体系（Data Engineer Professional 等）为英文考试 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (English-first, Chinese catching up). Official docs are English-first with partial machine-translated Chinese; Azure Databricks has more Chinese docum…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (English-first, Chinese catching up).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official docs are English-first with partial machine-translated Chinese; Azure Databricks has more Chinese documentation via the Microsoft ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Chinese blogs and courses are growing (CSDN, Zhihu, Geektime series), but deep content (tuning, Unity Catalog migration war stories) still runs a generation behind English <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Certification exams (e.g. Data Engineer Professional) are English-only <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Photon 向量化引擎：官方口径称相对开源 Spark 有数倍提升（TPC-DS 类基准），是 SQL 仓库与 DLT 的默认加速 厂商口径。 典型延迟：SQL 仓库交互式查询秒级（TB 级聚合常见，社区多方实测）；流处理端到端秒级；2026 年发布的 Lakehouse//RT（实时引擎 Reyden）把目标打到亚秒级并发查询 社区实…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Photon 向量化引擎：官方口径称相对开源 Spark 有数倍提升（TPC-DS 类基准），是 SQL 仓库与 DLT 的默认加速 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>典型延迟：SQL 仓库交互式查询秒级（TB 级聚合常见，社区多方实测）；流处理端到端秒级；2026 年发布的 Lakehouse//RT（实时引擎 Reyden）把目标打到亚秒级并发查询 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：毫秒级点查/高频 OLTP 不是设计目标；冷启动（经典集群拉起）曾是主要吐槽，Serverless 大幅缓解但仍非零 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Photon batch benchmark; interactive in seconds; OLTP not the target). Photon vectorized engine: vendor-claimed multi-fold speedups over open-source Spark on TP…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Photon batch benchmark; interactive in seconds; OLTP not the target).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photon vectorized engine: vendor-claimed multi-fold speedups over open-source Spark on TPC-DS-style benchmarks; the default accelerator for SQL warehouses and DLT <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Typical latencies: interactive SQL-warehouse queries in seconds (TB-scale aggregations commonly measured by the community); streaming end-to-end in seconds; the 2026 Lakehouse//RT launch (Reyden engine) targets sub-second concurrent queries <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>Boundary: millisecond point lookups / high-frequency OLTP are not the design target; cluster cold starts (classic) were the classic complaint — Serverless mitigates substantially but not to zero <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SOC 2 Type II、ISO/IEC 27001（2022 版，覆盖 AWS/Azure/GCP 三云）、ISO 27017/27018/27701、HIPAA、PCI-DSS、FedRAMP（指定区域）官方文档。 合规安全配置文件（Compliance Security Profile）一键强化：FIPS 加密模块、增强审计等，是…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SOC 2 Type II、ISO/IEC 27001（2022 版，覆盖 AWS/Azure/GCP 三云）、ISO 27017/27018/27701、HIPAA、PCI-DSS、FedRAMP（指定区域）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>合规安全配置文件（Compliance Security Profile）一键强化：FIPS 加密模块、增强审计等，是过等保/金融合规的标配动作 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：部分 AI 功能（如按 token 计费的 Foundation Model API）在非 HIPAA 合规档下受限；中国区无本地云（需经全球云部署）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (full SOC2/ISO/HIPAA/PCI/FedRAMP suite). SOC 2 Type II, ISO/IEC 27001:2022 (covering AWS/Azure/GCP), ISO 27017/27018/27701, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, FedRAMP (in designat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (full SOC2/ISO/HIPAA/PCI/FedRAMP suite).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SOC 2 Type II, ISO/IEC 27001:2022 (covering AWS/Azure/GCP), ISO 27017/27018/27701, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, FedRAMP (in designated regions) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Compliance Security Profile hardens in one switch — FIPS crypto modules, enhanced auditing — the standard move for regulated/financial compliance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Note: some AI features (pay-per-token Foundation Model APIs) are restricted outside HIPAA-class compliance profiles; no China-region cloud (deploy via global clouds) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">2013 年由 Spark 原班团队创立，总部旧金山，员工 8000+（2025-2026 口径）；2024 年 12 月估值 620 亿美元，2025 年底超千亿美元，仍未 IPO 社区共识。 Spark 本体社区与 Databricks 生态高度重叠：技术问答、第三方书籍、认证体系成熟；Delta Lake、MLflow 开源社区活跃…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>2013 年由 Spark 原班团队创立，总部旧金山，员工 8000+（2025-2026 口径）；2024 年 12 月估值 620 亿美元，2025 年底超千亿美元，仍未 IPO <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Spark 本体社区与 Databricks 生态高度重叠：技术问答、第三方书籍、认证体系成熟；Delta Lake、MLflow 开源社区活跃 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>风险面：未上市公司的长期定价与战略存在不确定性；平台迭代快，API/默认行为变更需要跟进 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (founded 2013; the de-facto Spark-ecosystem standard). Founded 2013 by the original Spark team, HQ San Francisco, 8,000+ employees (2025–2026 figures); valued a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (founded 2013; the de-facto Spark-ecosystem standard).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Founded 2013 by the original Spark team, HQ San Francisco, 8,000+ employees (2025–2026 figures); valued at $62B in Dec 2024, north of $100B by end of 2025, still private <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The Spark open-source community and the Databricks ecosystem heavily overlap: Q&amp;A, third-party books and a mature certification system; Delta Lake and MLflow open-source communities are active <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Risk side: as a private company, long-term pricing and strategy carry uncertainty; the platform iterates fast and API/default-behavior changes need tracking <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">公开客户：AT&amp;T、Block、Rivian、Walgreens、Mercedes-Benz、Shell、Siemens、Toyota、Warner Bros. Discovery；国内出海与跨国企业采用多 社区共识。 互联网/AI 公司是基本盘：MosaicML 被收购前就是客户，收购后成为 Mosaic AI 底座 社区共识。 采用模…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>公开客户：AT&amp;T、Block、Rivian、Walgreens、Mercedes-Benz、Shell、Siemens、Toyota、Warner Bros. Discovery；国内出海与跨国企业采用多 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>互联网/AI 公司是基本盘：MosaicML 被收购前就是客户，收购后成为 Mosaic AI 底座 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>采用模式常见：Databricks 做 ingestion/特征/训练，BI 层接 Power BI 或 Snowflake（双平台并存很常见）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AT&amp;T, Shell, Toyota and cross-industry others). Public customers: AT&amp;T, Block, Rivian, Walgreens, Mercedes-Benz, Shell, Siemens, Toyota, Warner Bros. Discovery…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AT&amp;T, Shell, Toyota and cross-industry others).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public customers: AT&amp;T, Block, Rivian, Walgreens, Mercedes-Benz, Shell, Siemens, Toyota, Warner Bros. Discovery; strong adoption among multinationals and companies expanding overseas <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Internet/AI companies are the home turf: MosaicML was a customer before the acquisition and became the Mosaic AI foundation after it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Common pattern: Databricks for ingestion/features/training, BI served from Power BI or Snowflake — dual-platform coexistence is normal <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">IaC：官方 Terraform Provider（工作区、集群、UC 权限、Job 全可代码化）；CI/CD 接 GitHub Actions/Azure DevOps 社区共识。 数据栈：dbt-databricks 适配器、Airflow Provider、Fivetran/Airbyte 等 ingestion 工具官方 conn…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>IaC：官方 Terraform Provider（工作区、集群、UC 权限、Job 全可代码化）；CI/CD 接 GitHub Actions/Azure DevOps <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>数据栈：dbt-databricks 适配器、Airflow Provider、Fivetran/Airbyte 等 ingestion 工具官方 connector <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ML：MLflow（Databricks 创始捐献）实验跟踪 + 模型注册 + Model Serving 一条龙 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Terraform/dbt/Airflow/MLflow fully covered). IaC: official Terraform provider (workspaces, clusters, UC grants, jobs — all as code); CI/CD via GitHub Actions /…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Terraform/dbt/Airflow/MLflow fully covered).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IaC: official Terraform provider (workspaces, clusters, UC grants, jobs — all as code); CI/CD via GitHub Actions / Azure DevOps <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Data stack: dbt-databricks adapter, Airflow provider, official connectors for Fivetran/Airbyte-class ingestion tools <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ML: MLflow (donated by Databricks&#x27; founders) for experiment tracking + model registry + Model Serving end to end <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">三云全覆盖：AWS / Azure（Azure Databricks 为微软一等集成）/ GCP；不支持私有化部署，专有云/本地机房只能走混合架构 官方文档。 Serverless SQL 仓库与 Serverless 计算：免集群运维、快速启停、按量计费；经典集群仍可用于需要深度定制（VPC 注入、特殊实例）的场景 官方文档。 成本注意…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>三云全覆盖：AWS / Azure（Azure Databricks 为微软一等集成）/ GCP；不支持私有化部署，专有云/本地机房只能走混合架构 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless SQL 仓库与 Serverless 计算：免集群运维、快速启停、按量计费；经典集群仍可用于需要深度定制（VPC 注入、特殊实例）的场景 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>成本注意：Serverless 单价高于经典 DBU，省的是运维与空转，不是单价；选型要按负载画像算总账 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (it is itself the cloud service; Serverless is the strategic default). All three clouds: AWS / Azure (Azure Databricks is a first-class Microsoft integration) /…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (it is itself the cloud service; Serverless is the strategic default).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All three clouds: AWS / Azure (Azure Databricks is a first-class Microsoft integration) / GCP; no private/on-premises deployment — regulated on-prem scenarios need a hybrid architecture <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless SQL warehouses and serverless compute: no cluster ops, fast start/stop, usage billing; classic clusters remain for deep customization (VPC injection, special instance types) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cost note: Serverless unit price exceeds classic DBUs — it saves ops and idle time, not unit price; choose by workload profile and do the total math <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Auto Loader（cloudFiles）：增量检测新文件落盘（S3/ADLS/GCS），schema 推断与演进，是&quot;文件进湖&quot;事实标准 官方文档。 COPY INTO：SQL 一次性/幂等批量加载；Delta Live Tables（现 Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines）：声明式 ETL，流批统一，内建…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Auto Loader（cloudFiles）：增量检测新文件落盘（S3/ADLS/GCS），schema 推断与演进，是&quot;文件进湖&quot;事实标准 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>COPY INTO：SQL 一次性/幂等批量加载；Delta Live Tables（现 Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines）：声明式 ETL，流批统一，内建数据质量期望（EXPECTATIONS）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流式：Spark Structured Streaming 直连 Kafka/Event Hubs/Kinesis，端到端 exactly-once 语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘：小文件碎片是湖仓通病，Auto Loader + OPTIMIZE/Z-ORDER 是标准治理动作；schema 漂移处理要显式设计 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Auto Loader + COPY INTO + DLT unified batch/streaming). Auto Loader (cloudFiles): incrementally detects new files landing in S3/ADLS/GCS with schema inference …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Auto Loader + COPY INTO + DLT unified batch/streaming).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Auto Loader (cloudFiles): incrementally detects new files landing in S3/ADLS/GCS with schema inference and evolution — the de-facto &quot;files into the lake&quot; standard <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>COPY INTO: idempotent SQL bulk loads; Delta Live Tables (now Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines): declarative ETL unifying batch and streaming with built-in data-quality expectations <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Streaming: Spark Structured Streaming straight into Kafka/Event Hubs/Kinesis with end-to-end exactly-once semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge: small-file fragmentation is the chronic lakehouse disease — Auto Loader plus OPTIMIZE/Z-ORDER is the standard regimen; schema drift needs explicit design <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">审计日志记录工作区操作、数据访问、权限变更等事件，可投递到客户 S3/ADLS（建议配对象锁定防篡改）再接入 Splunk/Datadog 官方文档。 Unity Catalog 的 system.access.audit 系统表可 SQL 直接查&quot;谁在何时访问了哪张表&quot;，是数据访问审计的主入口 官方文档。 注意：审计日志投递与保留策略要…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>审计日志记录工作区操作、数据访问、权限变更等事件，可投递到客户 S3/ADLS（建议配对象锁定防篡改）再接入 Splunk/Datadog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Unity Catalog 的 <code>system.access.audit</code> 系统表可 SQL 直接查&quot;谁在何时访问了哪张表&quot;，是数据访问审计的主入口 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：审计日志投递与保留策略要自己配；老工作区若未启用 Unity Catalog，表级审计粒度会打折 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (audit logs + system.access.audit). Audit logs capture workspace operations, data access and permission changes, deliverable to customer S3/ADLS (object lock re…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (audit logs + system.access.audit).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Audit logs capture workspace operations, data access and permission changes, deliverable to customer S3/ADLS (object lock recommended for tamper resistance) and onward to Splunk/Datadog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Unity Catalog&#x27;s <code>system.access.audit</code> table answers &quot;who accessed which table when&quot; directly in SQL — the primary data-access audit surface <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: log delivery and retention policies are yours to configure; on legacy workspaces without Unity Catalog, table-level audit granularity is weaker <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">对外共享：Delta Sharing 开放协议，把实时 Delta 表安全共享给外部组织，对方用任意引擎（Spark/Pandas/Power BI）读，无需复制数据 官方文档。 对内联邦：Lakehouse Federation 建外部连接（Connection）+ 外部目录（Foreign Catalog），直接查询 PostgreS…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>对外共享：Delta Sharing 开放协议，把实时 Delta 表安全共享给外部组织，对方用任意引擎（Spark/Pandas/Power BI）读，无需复制数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>对内联邦：Lakehouse Federation 建外部连接（Connection）+ 外部目录（Foreign Catalog），直接查询 PostgreSQL/MySQL/Snowflake/BigQuery 等源，查询下推到源端执行，走 Unity Catalog 统一鉴权审计 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：联邦查询适合即席探索与小结果集；大体量反复扫描、高频生产查询仍建议先入湖（延迟与源端负载不可控）；跨云 egress 费用自理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta Sharing for outbound; Lakehouse Federation for inbound queries). Outbound sharing: the Delta Sharing open protocol securely shares live Delta tables with…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta Sharing for outbound; Lakehouse Federation for inbound queries).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Outbound sharing: the Delta Sharing open protocol securely shares live Delta tables with external organizations — recipients read with any engine (Spark/pandas/Power BI), no data copying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Inbound federation: Lakehouse Federation creates external Connections + Foreign Catalogs to query PostgreSQL/MySQL/Snowflake/BigQuery in place, with pushdown to the source and unified Unity Catalog auth/audit <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Boundary: federation suits ad-hoc exploration and small result sets; repeated large scans and high-frequency production queries should still land in the lake first (latency and source load are uncontrollable); cross-cloud egress is on you <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Change Data Feed（CDF）：表级开启后，下游可增量读取行的插入/更新/删除变更，是湖内 CDC 标准机制 官方文档。 DLT/Lakeflow 管道：APPLY CHANGES INTO 语法直接消费上游 CDC 做 SCD Type 1/2 拉链 官方文档。 新方向：Lakebase（Databricks 的…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Change Data Feed（CDF）：表级开启后，下游可增量读取行的插入/更新/删除变更，是湖内 CDC 标准机制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DLT/Lakeflow 管道：<code>APPLY CHANGES INTO</code> 语法直接消费上游 CDC 做 SCD Type 1/2 拉链 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>新方向：Lakebase（Databricks 的 Postgres 兼容 OLTP）→ Delta 的 Lakehouse Sync 原生 CDC，无需外部作业即可把操作库变更流进数仓 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>下游：出湖仓可经 Delta Sharing、JDBC/ODBC、或写回 Kafka/对象存储；CDC 链路延迟通常在秒到分钟级，不是毫秒级同步 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta CDF + DLT + Lakebase Sync). Delta Change Data Feed (CDF): enable per table and downstream consumers incrementally read row-level inserts/updates/deletes …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta CDF + DLT + Lakebase Sync).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Change Data Feed (CDF): enable per table and downstream consumers incrementally read row-level inserts/updates/deletes — the in-lake CDC standard <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DLT/Lakeflow pipelines: <code>APPLY CHANGES INTO</code> consumes upstream CDC directly into SCD Type 1/2 historization <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>New direction: Lakebase (Databricks&#x27; Postgres-compatible OLTP) to Delta via Lakehouse Sync — native CDC streaming operational changes into the warehouse with no external jobs <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Downstream: exit via Delta Sharing, JDBC/ODBC, or write-back to Kafka/object storage; CDC pipeline latency is typically seconds to minutes, not millisecond sync <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta 表可设保留期，VACUUM 按保留期清理旧文件版本 官方文档。 流式表/物化视图的增量过期逻辑需自己写清理任务 官方文档。 VACUUM 默认 7 天保留期防并发读写冲突，调小有风险 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta 表可设保留期，VACUUM 按保留期清理旧文件版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流式表/物化视图的增量过期逻辑需自己写清理任务 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>VACUUM 默认 7 天保留期防并发读写冲突，调小有风险 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta retention + VACUUM; custom cleanup for streaming). Delta tables support retention periods; VACUUM reclaims old file versions per retention (official docs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta retention + VACUUM; custom cleanup for streaming).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta tables support retention periods; VACUUM reclaims old file versions per retention <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Streaming tables/materialized views need custom cleanup jobs for expiry logic <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>VACUUM defaults to 7-day retention to protect concurrent readers; lowering it is risky <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake 支持 schema 自动演进与 mergeSchema，流批写入加列不中断 官方文档。 列改名/改类型需 overwrite 或 column mapping，有代价 官方文档。 Unity Catalog 下表结构变更可审计 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake 支持 schema 自动演进与 mergeSchema，流批写入加列不中断 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>列改名/改类型需 overwrite 或 column mapping，有代价 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Unity Catalog 下表结构变更可审计 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta schema evolution / mergeSchema). Delta Lake supports automatic schema evolution and mergeSchema; streaming/batch writes tolerate new columns (official do…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta schema evolution / mergeSchema).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake supports automatic schema evolution and mergeSchema; streaming/batch writes tolerate new columns <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Renames / type changes need overwrite or column mapping, at a cost <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Schema changes are auditable under Unity Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">工作区、集群/ SQL Warehouse 按团队隔离，Unity Catalog 做数据权限 官方文档。 计算资源按集群/仓库隔离，noisy neighbor 天然规避 官方文档。 成本归因到工作区/集群标签，FinOps 友好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>工作区、集群/ SQL Warehouse 按团队隔离，Unity Catalog 做数据权限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计算资源按集群/仓库隔离，noisy neighbor 天然规避 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>成本归因到工作区/集群标签，FinOps 友好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Workspace/cluster isolation + Unity Catalog). Workspaces, clusters / SQL warehouses isolate teams; Unity Catalog governs data access <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Compute i…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Workspace/cluster isolation + Unity Catalog).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Workspaces, clusters / SQL warehouses isolate teams; Unity Catalog governs data access <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Compute is isolated per cluster/warehouse, sidestepping noisy neighbors <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cost attribution via workspace/cluster tags is FinOps-friendly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Sharing 可跨区/跨云共享数据读 官方文档。 写仍是单工作区/单区，无多活写入语义 社区共识。 region 容灾靠工作区备份重建，RTO 看数据量 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Sharing 可跨区/跨云共享数据读 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>写仍是单工作区/单区，无多活写入语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>region 容灾靠工作区备份重建，RTO 看数据量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Delta Sharing cross-region reads; no cross-region writes). Delta Sharing shares data for reads across regions/clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Writes stay single-workspac…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Delta Sharing cross-region reads; no cross-region writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Sharing shares data for reads across regions/clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Writes stay single-workspace/single-region; no active-active write semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Region DR means rebuilding workspaces; RTO scales with data <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">控制平面托管高可用，计算集群故障可重建恢复 官方文档。 Delta Lake 的 ACID 让任务重跑不脏数据，RPO 靠检查点 社区共识。 SLA 是平台级，具体 RTO 看集群重建时间 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>控制平面托管高可用，计算集群故障可重建恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Delta Lake 的 ACID 让任务重跑不脏数据，RPO 靠检查点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>SLA 是平台级，具体 RTO 看集群重建时间 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Managed control plane; compute clusters rebuildable). Managed control plane is HA; failed compute clusters rebuild <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Delta Lake ACID keeps retries…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Managed control plane; compute clusters rebuildable).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Managed control plane is HA; failed compute clusters rebuild <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Delta Lake ACID keeps retries clean; RPO follows checkpoints <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>SLA is platform-level; actual RTO follows cluster rebuild time <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Databricks Unity Catalog 提供 Row Filters（行过滤）与 Column Masks（列掩码），SQL 定义、集中治理 官方文档 支持列级权限与动态视图 官方文档 仅 Unity Catalog 治理的表生效；外部表 / 旧 Hive metastore 路径是绕过面 社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Databricks Unity Catalog 提供 Row Filters（行过滤）与 Column Masks（列掩码），SQL 定义、集中治理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>支持列级权限与动态视图 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>仅 Unity Catalog 治理的表生效；外部表 / 旧 Hive metastore 路径是绕过面 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Unity Catalog row filters + column masks). Databricks Unity Catalog provides Row Filters and Column Masks, defined in SQL and centrally governed (official docs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Unity Catalog row filters + column masks).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Databricks Unity Catalog provides Row Filters and Column Masks, defined in SQL and centrally governed <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column-level privileges and dynamic views are supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Only effective on Unity Catalog-governed tables; external tables / legacy Hive metastore paths are a bypass surface <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">VARIANT 半结构化类型（Photon），schema-on-read，自动演进 官方文档。 VARIANT 查询性能弱于规整列，热点路径建议规整化 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>VARIANT 半结构化类型（Photon），schema-on-read，自动演进 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>VARIANT 查询性能弱于规整列，热点路径建议规整化 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (VARIANT type, schema-on-read). VARIANT semi-structured type (Photon) with schema-on-read and auto-evolution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. VARIANT queries slower than regula…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (VARIANT type, schema-on-read).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>VARIANT semi-structured type (Photon) with schema-on-read and auto-evolution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>VARIANT queries slower than regular columns; normalize hot paths <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Databricks SQL 无传统全文索引 官方文档。 文本检索靠向量搜索/AI 检索，关键词精确检索弱 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Databricks SQL 无传统全文索引 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>文本检索靠向量搜索/AI 检索，关键词精确检索弱 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native FTS; AI search separate). No classic full-text indexes in Databricks SQL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Text search via vector/AI retrieval; keyword-exact search is …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native FTS; AI search separate).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No classic full-text indexes in Databricks SQL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Text search via vector/AI retrieval; keyword-exact search is weak <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">身份：SSO（SAML/OIDC）、MFA、SCIM 用户同步；自动化用 Service Principal 而非个人账号 官方文档。 授权：Unity Catalog 三级命名空间（catalog.schema.table）统一管表、文件（Volume）、模型、函数乃至 AI Agent 的权限；支持行级安全、列掩码、动态视图 官方文档…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>身份：SSO（SAML/OIDC）、MFA、SCIM 用户同步；自动化用 Service Principal 而非个人账号 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>授权：Unity Catalog 三级命名空间（catalog.schema.table）统一管表、文件（Volume）、模型、函数乃至 AI Agent 的权限；支持行级安全、列掩码、动态视图 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>遗留坑：2023 年前建的老工作区可能是 Hive Metastore 模式，权限是另一套；迁移到 Unity Catalog 是生产合规的必经之路，迁移本身有工作量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (SSO + fine-grained Unity Catalog RBAC). Identity: SSO (SAML/OIDC), MFA, SCIM user sync; automation uses service principals, not personal accounts (official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (SSO + fine-grained Unity Catalog RBAC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identity: SSO (SAML/OIDC), MFA, SCIM user sync; automation uses service principals, not personal accounts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Authorization: Unity Catalog&#x27;s three-level namespace (catalog.schema.table) governs tables, files (Volumes), models, functions and even AI agents under one model; row-level security, column masking and dynamic views supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Legacy trap: workspaces created before ~2023 may run the Hive Metastore permission model, which is a different system; migrating to Unity Catalog is real project work and effectively mandatory for compliance-grade production <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake 基于 Parquet 列存，默认 ZSTD/Snappy 压缩，压缩比高。官方文档 Photon 引擎与自动 OPTIMIZE（Z-Order、自动压缩）进一步提升存储与查询效率。官方文档 开放格式下压缩参数用户可调，透明度高于纯黑盒云数仓。社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake 基于 Parquet 列存，默认 ZSTD/Snappy 压缩，压缩比高。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Photon 引擎与自动 OPTIMIZE（Z-Order、自动压缩）进一步提升存储与查询效率。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>开放格式下压缩参数用户可调，透明度高于纯黑盒云数仓。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta columnar with ZSTD plus auto-optimization). Delta Lake is Parquet-based columnar with default ZSTD/Snappy compression and high ratios. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Th…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta columnar with ZSTD plus auto-optimization).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake is Parquet-based columnar with default ZSTD/Snappy compression and high ratios. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The Photon engine and auto-OPTIMIZE (Z-Order, auto-compaction) further improve storage and query efficiency. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>With open formats, compression parameters are user-tunable — more transparent than black-box cloud warehouses. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake、Spark 等核心技术开源（Apache 2.0），数据以开放格式（Delta/Parquet）存储，可迁出。官方文档 Databricks 平台（Runtime 优化、Unity Catalog、AI 功能）为闭源，深度使用后存在平台绑定。厂商口径 开放格式是实质缓解：数据本身不被锁定，锁定的是计算与治理层。社区共…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake、Spark 等核心技术开源（Apache 2.0），数据以开放格式（Delta/Parquet）存储，可迁出。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Databricks 平台（Runtime 优化、Unity Catalog、AI 功能）为闭源，深度使用后存在平台绑定。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>开放格式是实质缓解：数据本身不被锁定，锁定的是计算与治理层。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Delta/Spark open; platform closed). Core technologies (Delta Lake, Spark) are open source (Apache 2.0); data lives in open formats (Delta/Parquet) and can leave.…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Delta/Spark open; platform closed).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Core technologies (Delta Lake, Spark) are open source (Apache 2.0); data lives in open formats (Delta/Parquet) and can leave. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The Databricks platform (Runtime optimizations, Unity Catalog, AI features) is closed source; deep use creates platform binding. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Open formats are real mitigation: the data itself is not locked in — the compute and governance layers are. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Photon 引擎 + Spark CBO，自适应查询执行（AQE）运行时调优 官方文档。 支持 Spark SQL hint 干预计划 官方文档。 计划翻转少于传统数仓，但 AQE 行为不透明难排查 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Photon 引擎 + Spark CBO，自适应查询执行（AQE）运行时调优 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>支持 Spark SQL hint 干预计划 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计划翻转少于传统数仓，但 AQE 行为不透明难排查 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Photon + CBO + AQE; Spark hints available). Photon engine + Spark CBO with adaptive query execution (AQE) runtime tuning <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Spark SQL hints can s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Photon + CBO + AQE; Spark hints available).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photon engine + Spark CBO with adaptive query execution (AQE) runtime tuning <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Spark SQL hints can steer plans <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Fewer flips than legacy warehouses, but opaque AQE behavior is hard to debug <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Photon 自动向量化，Liquid Clustering 自动数据布局，调参极少 官方文档。 自动优化（auto optimize/compaction）后台进行 官方文档。 集群规格选择仍是成本主因 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Photon 自动向量化，Liquid Clustering 自动数据布局，调参极少 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>自动优化（auto optimize/compaction）后台进行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>集群规格选择仍是成本主因 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Strong autonomy: Photon + auto liquid clustering). Photon auto-vectorizes; Liquid Clustering auto-manages layout; minimal knobs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Auto-optimize/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Strong autonomy: Photon + auto liquid clustering).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photon auto-vectorizes; Liquid Clustering auto-manages layout; minimal knobs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Auto-optimize/compaction runs in the background <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cluster sizing remains the main cost lever <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据文件落云对象存储，完整性依赖云厂商底层校验与冗余。厂商口径 Delta Lake 提供事务日志与版本化，逻辑损坏可回滚版本，但非静默位损坏检测。官方文档 无用户可配的页/块校验开关，损坏审计依赖云厂商。待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据文件落云对象存储，完整性依赖云厂商底层校验与冗余。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Delta Lake 提供事务日志与版本化，逻辑损坏可回滚版本，但非静默位损坏检测。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无用户可配的页/块校验开关，损坏审计依赖云厂商。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud storage checks; no user switch). Data files sit on cloud object storage; integrity depends on provider-level checks and redundancy. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> Delta La…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud storage checks; no user switch).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data files sit on cloud object storage; integrity depends on provider-level checks and redundancy. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Delta Lake provides transaction logs and versioning, so logical corruption can roll back, but silent bit-rot detection is not its job. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No user-configurable page/block checksum switch; corruption auditing depends on the provider. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">无传统存储过程；靠 Notebooks/Workflows 编排，DBSQL 有脚本能力 官方文档。 去 O 迁移时 PL/SQL 逻辑需重写为作业流 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无传统存储过程；靠 Notebooks/Workflows 编排，DBSQL 有脚本能力 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>去 O 迁移时 PL/SQL 逻辑需重写为作业流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Scripts/workflows; no classic SPs). No classic stored procedures; orchestration via Notebooks/Workflows <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Oracle PL/SQL logic must be rewritten as…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Scripts/workflows; no classic SPs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No classic stored procedures; orchestration via Notebooks/Workflows <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle PL/SQL logic must be rewritten as job flows <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});